`DestinationCalendarSettingsWebWrapper` was moved into `apps/web/components/apps/`, but it still reaches into the atoms package with `../../../../packages/platform/...` paths. That is the same cross-package coupling the PR is meant to remove, and it contradicts the PR's "Updates since last revision" note, which says the deep relative imports were fixed. The fix in `EventTypeWebWrapper.tsx` used the `@calcom/atoms` alias, but this file was left as a deep relative path.

The path is also fragile: it breaks if the file moves, and it bypasses the package exports the PR just wired up.

